                    "details": "- Sets the outer window frame's top-left position to `(x, y)`. For coordinate units and the macOS screen conversion, see `getWindowPosition`.\n- Does nothing when no native window is available. On Windows, moving the window does not resize it, activate it or change its stacking order.",
