            "details": "- This integer constant is `500`; pass it as the priority argument to `AudioEngine::audioOut.listen(...)` for effects that read and modify the audio buffer.\n- Effects run after `audio::priority::Generator` and before `audio::priority::Monitor`. See `audio::priority::Generator` for shared ordering and callback rules.",
