                    "desc": "Sets the node's visible state.",
                    "inherited": "Node",
                    "details": "- The flag defaults to `true`. When its value changes, the setter stores it and immediately calls `onVisibleChanged(visible)` on this node; setting the same value does nothing.\n- See `Node::setActive` for how visibility affects descendants, drawing, events, and timers.\n- This API is available in C++ only.",
