                    "desc": "Interpolates toward another color directly in sRGB space.",
                    "details": "- Interpolates the stored `r`, `g`, and `b` values directly with `component + (targetComponent - component) * t`, without a color space conversion.\n- Interpolation in sRGB space is not perceptually uniform.\n- See `Color::lerp` for `target`, `t`, alpha, and result handling.",
