                    "details": "- Returns `true` only when `Platform::isWeb()` is `true` and the backend is OpenGL ES 3; this corresponds to GLES3 under Emscripten. Returns `false` otherwise, including native OpenGL ES 3.\n- See `GraphicsBackend::name` for initialization requirements shared by these queries.",
