                    "desc": "Reads the JSON value for one reflected member.",
                    "details": "- Looks up `name` in the current source object and writes an accepted value into the supplied reference. The reflection caller invokes a property setter when applicable; `visit()` itself does not call it.\n- Returns `true` and records the name in `applied` for accepted values, even if the value is unchanged. Returns `false` for absent, mismatched, or read-only values.\n- See `JsonReadReflector` for accepted types and result-list rules.",
