                    "desc": "Sets the spacing between children.",
                    "details": "- Stores the `float` argument `spacing` as the gap between consecutive participating children, immediately calls `updateLayout()`, and returns `*this` as `LayoutMod&` for chaining. The default spacing is `0.0f`.\n- For coordinate units and which children participate, see `LayoutMod::updateLayout`.",
