                    "details": "- Returns the stored `float` roughness in the range `0.045f`–`1.0f`; the default is `0.5f`. Lower values produce sharper reflections, and higher values produce broader reflections.\n- This is the factor before multiplication by the metallic-roughness texture's green channel.",
