                    "snippet": "Mesh mesh;\nvoid tcApp::setup() {\n    mesh = createPlane(200, 200);\n    mesh.clear();\n    mesh.addVertices({Vec3(100, 100, 0), Vec3(200, 100, 0), Vec3(150, 200, 0)});\n}\n",
