                    "details": "- Copies `pos.x` to `x` and `pos.y` to `y`; it takes no arguments and returns no value.\n- Call `e.syncLegacy()` after manually changing `e.pos` if compatibility code still reads `x` or `y`. These fields will be removed at v1.0; new code should use `pos`.",
