                    "desc": "Sets the local rotation from Euler angles in radians.",
                    "inherited": "Node",
                    "details": "- Accepts `setEuler(const Vec3& euler)` or `setEuler(float pitch, float yaw, float roll)`, with pitch in X, yaw in Y, and roll in Z. Converts the angles to a quaternion and replaces the current orientation.\n- See `Node::setRot` for the Euler convention, matrix invalidation, and change notifications.",
                    "details_ja": "- `setEuler(const Vec3& euler)` または `setEuler(float pitch, float yaw, float roll)` を使います。X が pitch、Y が yaw、Z が roll です。角度をクォータニオンに変換して現在の姿勢を置き換えます。\n- オイラー角の規約、行列キャッシュの無効化、変更通知は `Node::setRot` を参照してください。",
