                    "desc": "Decode a FLAC file into the buffer.",
                    "details": "- Uses miniaudio to decode the complete file into interleaved float PCM, preserving the source channel count and sample rate.\n- Returns `LoadResult`; see `SoundBuffer::load` for path resolution, failure behavior, cancellation, and threading rules.",
