                    "desc": "Sets the end-cap shape of the stroke.",
                    "details": "- Accepts `StrokeMesh::CAP_BUTT`, `StrokeMesh::CAP_ROUND`, or `StrokeMesh::CAP_SQUARE`; the default is `StrokeMesh::CAP_BUTT`. Shapes are described in `StrokeMesh::CapType`.\n- Rebuilding and method chaining are described in `StrokeMesh::update`.",
                    "details_ja": "- `StrokeMesh::CAP_BUTT`、`StrokeMesh::CAP_ROUND`、`StrokeMesh::CAP_SQUARE` を指定します。既定値は `StrokeMesh::CAP_BUTT` です。形状については `StrokeMesh::CapType` を参照してください。\n- 再構築とメソッドチェーンについては `StrokeMesh::update` を参照してください。",
                    "details_ko": "- `StrokeMesh::CAP_BUTT`, `StrokeMesh::CAP_ROUND` 또는 `StrokeMesh::CAP_SQUARE`를 지정합니다. 기본값은 `StrokeMesh::CAP_BUTT`입니다. 모양은 `StrokeMesh::CapType`을 참조하세요.\n- 재구축과 메서드 체이닝은 `StrokeMesh::update`를 참조하세요.",
