                    "desc": "Sets the clipboard buffer capacity.",
                    "details": "- Stores `size` in `clipboardSize`, in bytes; see `WindowSettings::clipboardSize` for defaults and platform limits.\n- Returns `WindowSettings&`; see `WindowSettings::setSize` for the shared setter rules.",
